## Title: Super Swing Timer
## Notes: Melee, ranged, and current-target enemy swing timer for Classic Era, TBC Anniversary, and Titanforge. Includes interactive Move Mode with floating lock toolbar, decoupled responsive settings panel for 1080p, class-colored swing bars, Rogue Slice & Dice and energy-tick assists, Hunter Auto Shot / Multi-Shot cast bar with Steady Shot no-clip feedback, Warrior Shield Block duration bar, Paladin seal twist marker, Shaman weave assists, and customizable textures and colors.
